<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces have seized additional Tigray cities while fighting continues, and severe drought and prolonged conflict are driving acute hunger in Amhara, Tigray and Afar. Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. An RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, and attacks on Orthodox Christians persist in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, with blasts heard in Addis Ababa. Seed insecurity threatens Tigray farmers and a psychosocial and spiritual care pilot is being tested, while displacement exceeds 50,000 people, and 2,824 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBvR0ZFTTdYWHlfOVJZeWMxUnZDZ3NMZ2tnb1BYeFdSR3FzZ0FsQWZKYmNFYjdQUkhSVE5nMFFpS2RpQXhNRkN6ZnNlZlFPcnJQRi1jZ2hOb2hBVlVVN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUGVzemFrbHVZeTRzOGZXcnpNZFZ2ZVNwb3JYMDZONUZzblVDMVJBVngwcHZVRlhENUc0U19abmRjX2lpcFNiMktBa0htc1lYT0M4QU9Rd3FJSnNLSV84WnFBTGlFbDRYd2w0RC1PTUlubnA0YTh4ZU56UHdDX0dPdnFvLWdDQmIya2Z2X1h4YVh2MW14dmdIQ3BxalM5VllpUHVyV1BBRWNzRXZIekpEam5QWU04RVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQM0ljcUcybHN4RElqdEVQeG1VZG5LOUZDR2xWRWlpTllLWmlkYmFMSWJMcGJVNHdBeG1CTzZ2djgtcVNHRX